{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_182_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_182","textTraditional":"一、二年。春，晉侯使韓起來聘。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_182_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_182","textTraditional":"二、夏，叔弓如晉。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_182_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_182","textTraditional":"三、秋，鄭殺其大夫公孫黑。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_182_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_182","textTraditional":"四、冬，公如晉，至河乃復。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_182_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_182","textTraditional":"其言至河乃復何？不敢進也。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_182_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_182","textTraditional":"五、季孫宿如晉。","sentenceOrder":6}],"overrides":{}}